# their prices from the US version"; treasure maps 3000/6000/9000 by area; upgrades; first aid sprays "rely on how many
# you have"). The retail main.dol files, read with retail_code.py on 02.11.2026 (port/docs/whole-program-status.md,
# "Händlerpreise und Waffenwerte der Verkaufsfassungen"), have their own merchant and damage balance; the Japanese
# (and Korean) code and data are the European ones. Taken over for the retail discs only, the debug build's discs keep
# the prototype's (patch 0146 had left the balance out):
# - merchant.cpp: g_item_price_tbl (values and order, US and European), level_price rows 0x23 / 0x2A (both) and 0x2C
