#   with modes (a cleared game adds a spray per room and the extra tables at every room; no Merchant2ndRoundInit),
#   level_r229 in r229 and level_r10e_day at night (European), add_stock with the count and at most 999 (0x6D one at
#   most), stockAdd (European: a weapon sold goes into the stock), stockNum (European: first aid sprays by the healing
#   items in the case, the endless rocket launcher once, the vest not on Professional), the treasure maps only in their
#   area, buyupPrice (weapon parts half, 500,000 for 0x6D / 0x34, the handcannon without ammo), sellPrice (European:
#   attache case M 12,000 on Easy);
# - item.cpp itemInfo: 0xA2 and the gems 0xDC..0xF3 one per slot; European Easy 20 rifle rounds, 25 shells, 10 darts;
# - em_dm_val.cpp: the class tables (US: em31, em39; European: all but em3c / sml, one table more for 0x36, another
#   for 0x32 / 0x35 / 0x38), WeaponLevelTbl rows 3, 4, 9, 0x11 (European) and 0x2C (both), rounding (European);
